THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
--------------------

The simulated robot and its Gazebo assets originate from
ROS2-Forklift-Simulation by Can Gozpinar (https://github.com/cangozpi), and are
included here in modified form:

    src/forklift_robot/urdf/*.xacro          forklift description and sensors
    src/forklift_robot/rviz/*.rviz           RViz layouts
    src/forklift_gym_env/worlds/*.world      Gazebo worlds
    src/forklift_gym_env/models/pallet/      pallet model, mesh and texture
    src/ros_gazebo_plugins/src/*             contact-sensor plugin (C++)

That upstream project does not carry a license file, so no license terms were
granted with it and these files are not covered by the Apache-2.0 grant above.
They are included on the understanding that the work is published for reference
and reuse; if you are the author and would prefer they were removed or licensed
explicitly, please open an issue and it will be actioned.

Everything else in this repository -- the Gymnasium environment, both simulation
backends, the observation and reward registries, the TD3/DDPG implementation and
replay buffers, the training and evaluation loops, the CLI, configuration
system, tests, CI and packaging -- is original work under the Apache-2.0 grant
above.

The pallet mesh (src/forklift_gym_env/models/pallet/meshes/) is a third-party
asset redistributed by the upstream project; its own provenance is not recorded
there.
